# Local object storage runtime artifacts: generated asset files, demo uploads,
# generated report PDFs, research captures. These are outputs of running the app,
# not source, so they are ignored by default.
#
# NOTE: .gitignore never untracks files already in the index. The 43 historical
# files (42 demo cover images + 1 db backup) committed in the project snapshot
# stay tracked and keep working; new asset/capture files need `git add -f`.
backend/data/

# Agent / editor working memory. The four files already tracked
# (memory/MEMORY.md and the dated notes committed in the project snapshot)
# keep working; new dated notes are ignored by default. Note that a .gitignore
# rule never untracks a file already in the index.
.workbuddy/memory/2026-*.md
.impeccable/
